<title>ISRAEL: SOCCER-ISRAEL BEAT LUXEMBOURG 2-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ISRAEL BEAT LUXEMBOURG 2-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>HERZLIYA, Israel 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel beat Luxembourg</p>
<p>2-1 (halftime 2-0) in their European under-21 soccer</p>
<p>championship group five qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Israel - Manor Hassan 6, Nir Sivilia 27 (penalty)</p>
<p>Luxembourg - Frank Walther 87</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,000</p>
</text>
